#: capturedialog.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Opens the Configure Dialog where you can choose the settings about the "
"capture.</p>"
"<p>In case you don't request all the options, the capture will start using the "
"default settings.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Abre o Diálogo de Configurazón onde poderá configurar a captura.</p>"
"<p>Se non configura todas as opzóns, a captura comeza coas predefinidas.</p>"
